WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.299
Subtract B from A.

00:00:01.299 --> 00:00:02.923
Difference = A XOR B.

00:00:02.923 --> 00:00:04.872
Borrow = NOT A AND B.

00:00:04.872 --> 00:00:08.445
Borrow indicates that the next higher position must supply a unit.

00:00:09.445 --> 00:00:10.744
Subtract B from A.

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:12.368
